  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Psychosocial Services for Traumatized Persons in Conflict-Affected Areas in Thailand&apos;s Deep South</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective is to enhance the delivery of psychosocial services in the three conflict-affected provinces of Thailand&apos;s Deep South. This will be achieved through improved curriculum design and trainingcomma strengthened capacity of first-line service providerscomma and proposed modalities to integrate psychosocial services and livelihood support.</narrative>
  </description>
